{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117220","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1011722001:0":{"text":"그러고 보니, 바투소 산맥은 어떤 곳인가요?","source_cn":"说起来，瓦度索山脉是什么地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12249210135FCC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011722002:0":{"text":"그곳에도 많은 와일더스 연맹 멤버들이 살고 있어. 우린 같은 신앙을 공유하고 있지.","source_cn":"那里也有许多绿裔联盟成员生活，我们拥有共同的信仰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD65BBC8DFD5CB912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011722003:0":{"text":"하지만 우리와는 달리 더욱 초탈한 철학을 가지고 있고, 땅거미 숲은 가끔 그들과 왕래하지만 많지는 않아.","source_cn":"但他们与我们理念有所不同，更加出世，薄暮丛林与他们偶有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BA7B730F7692EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011722004:0":{"text":"그곳에서 아든 현자와 황혼의 나무를 구할 수 있는 방법을 하루 빨리 찾을 수 있기를...","source_cn":"希望我们在那里能尽快找到雅顿贤者，和拯救流荧树的方法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x322B3D73F05D389F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,